  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...10...12 spirit. This spirit causes 3...9...10 Health loss each second to foes within earshot. This spirit loses 3...9...10 Health for each foe hurt in this way. This spirit dies after 30...78...90 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "創造一隻等級 1～12 的極痛縛靈。此縛靈將使音量所及範圍內的敵人每秒失去 3～10 體力。此縛靈也將依照因此受到傷害的每一敵人而失去 3～10 體力。極痛縛靈在 30～90 秒後消失。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...7...8 spirit. This spirit causes 3...9...10 Health loss each second to foes within earshot. This spirit loses 3...9...10 Health for each foe hurt in this way. This spirit dies after 30...78...90 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "召喚等級 1～8 的靈體，持續 30～90 秒。它每秒讓聽距內敵人失去 3～10 體力，並為每個受影響敵人損失同量體力。"
    }
  },
